[{"title":"子骏作真率会招安之不至二首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"乡闾贵老宁牵彊，德齿俱尊合便安。\n况是耆英会中客，须同八十主人看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42004,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子骏作真率会招安之不至二首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"齐眉举案人谁似，异膳常珍必自调。\n真率攀邀宜莫应，蚍蜉大木固难摇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42005,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十六日张伯常见访赏月四首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"空庭待月喜佳宾，杯杓频传酒易醺。\n长笛悠扬侵万籁，圆蟾潋滟出重云。\n辞荣风节轻三事，破的功能伏一军。\n高兴未阑天宇静，笑谈不觉夜将分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42006,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十六日张伯常见访赏月四首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"老来尤喜见朋游，况是才名第一流。\n今日偶逢甘共醉，他年相忆苦三秋。\n高吟洒落过千首，遗爱深浓在几州。\n我亦官閒少拘检，留连宁复问更筹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42007,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十六日张伯常见访赏月四首 其三","author":"范纯仁","text":"白首相知有几人，良宵难惜醉醺醺。\n此心直欲清如月，外物何妨薄似云。\n饮若长鲸吞巨浪，诗如老将纳降军。\n过从幸得閒中乐，好恶荣枯莫彊分。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42008,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"八月十六日张伯常见访赏月四首 其四","author":"范纯仁","text":"今夕无烦秉烛游，露华垂叶若珠流。\n翰林偏爱尊中月，词客休悲洛下秋。\n金谷池台多胜概，伊川山水近神州。\n从兹只合追清景，世故何烦妄计筹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42009,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子骏洛中书事","author":"范纯仁","text":"周公作邑遗成康，玉帛从兹走万方。\n四向山河围殿阁，千家花竹间田桑。\n游人选胜停车马，词客寻春杂咏觞。\n幸得閒官陪几杖，欲酬佳句愧荒唐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42010,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实姚黄玉玲珑二品牡丹二首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"洛城花美四方归，独有姚黄得见稀。\n曾入黼闱参近侍，分明新染赭黄衣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42011,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实姚黄玉玲珑二品牡丹二首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"花得新朋自我公，洁如明玉状玲珑。\n芳心有待人难见，小圃深藏洛水东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42012,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"元日分壶酒赠杨舜俞大卿","author":"范纯仁","text":"一别年光已浃辰，相逢重忆蜀江春。\n欲知盈榼分甘意，旨酒思柔属故人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42013,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄和浮光曹九章大夫","author":"范纯仁","text":"贤守班条俗易从，戴其仁厚服其功。\n虚心足以求民瘼，实效应须柬帝衷。\n缱绻交情由道合，连绵榜契复官同。\n当时赐第今无几，共喜优游作老翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42014,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"妙觉晚吟呈席上诸公","author":"范纯仁","text":"半生奔走困尘埃，晚得优游掌旧台。\n庭柏岁寒青独在，林乌朝夕倦重来。\n閒沾薄禄诚多愧，老向清朝信不才。\n唯喜洛城俦侣盛，从容相遇即衔杯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42015,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送伯常归郢中","author":"范纯仁","text":"穰邓相看少壮时，中间薄宦阻亲依。\n幸君西洛休官早，值我东齐谢病归。\n春色满城游骑纵，月光照席酒觥飞。\n遥知汉上幽栖乐，饱暖全家卧翠微。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42016,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩子华相公同游王君贶园二首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"隅陪旌旆纵春游，好景偏销倦客愁。\n红杏都开如趁赏，夭桃欲坼尚含羞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42017,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩子华相公同游王君贶园二首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"善政多閒若解牛，寻春选胜遍深幽。\n红芳翠竹围松岛，彊醉清尊盖自由。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42018,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实雨中即事二首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"放尽群花春欲归，惜春游乐幸相依。\n不堪风雨成暌阻，卧听萧骚洒竹扉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42019,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实雨中即事二首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"熟寝翻知计虑长，閒斋一枕事都忘。\n自然便是无何境，梦到华胥亦异乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42020,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"君实邀游南园雨止","author":"范纯仁","text":"名园选胜许参陪，游骑俄冲急雨回。\n花里不闻莺弄舌，瓮头空爱蚁浮醅。\n寒云重结三冬雪，暖律虚飞二纪灰。\n深恐群芳便彫落，主人还引上春台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42021,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"子华相公应天院行香归洛川","author":"范纯仁","text":"春色鲜明满洛川，青芜白鸟望中閒。\n千门金碧明初日，四面烟岚簇远山。\n桥偃长虹当上苑，水淙鸣玉过通阛。\n乘骢幸托车尘后，时赖清尊破客颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42022,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实南园独酌三首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"晚年光景更关心，尤向芳时惜寸阴。\n每到园林花好处，常思贳醉解貂金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42023,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实南园独酌三首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"寒食三春气候深，落英榆荚满墙阴。\n未甘密叶成翠幄，不爱黄花如散金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42024,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和君实南园独酌三首 其三","author":"范纯仁","text":"累日怀贤痗寸心，谁知独酌醉花阴。\n公诗字字如珠玉，并得三篇胜万金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42025,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬韩持国","author":"范纯仁","text":"独想当年春宴游，湖边日日醉金瓯。\n三年阻作登龙客，不谓相思已白头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42026,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牡丹二首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"牡丹奇擅洛都春，百卉千花浪纠纷。\n国色鲜明舒嫩脸，仙冠重叠剪红云。\n竞驰经品供天赏，旋立佳名竦众闻。\n园吏遮藏恐凋落，直攲青盖过残曛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42027,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牡丹二首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"夺尽春光胜尽花，都人巧植斗鲜华。\n搜奇不惮过民舍，醉赏唯愁污相车。\n密蕊攒心承晓露，繁红添色映朝霞。\n何妨纵步家家到，园圃相望幸不赊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42028,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上巳泛舟酬子华相公","author":"范纯仁","text":"佳节仍逢善政初，熙然民物在华胥。\n龙楼影里回仙棹，隼旆光中从相车。\n明媚山川铺晚照，啁啾丝管响清虚。\n太平应似羲皇世，早晚重看洛出书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42029,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和文潞公归洛赏花","author":"范纯仁","text":"公从帝所享钧天，归及三春景物妍。\n洛鲤烹鲜随玉馔，姚黄开晚待琼筵。\n身同五福居周分，心似南风助舜弦。\n花木只堪供暂赏，直须嵩少伴长年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42030,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子华陪文潞公宴东田","author":"范纯仁","text":"湍流湱湱走平田，清旷园林未暑天。\n绕圃曲堤都种竹，泛舟双沼不栽莲。\n沙边白鹭翘来静，丛上幽花晚更妍。\n乘月陪欢忘夜久，莎间潜有露珠圆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42031,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"三纪中书更有谁，致君尧舜似皋夔。\n频年力请方归第，天子临轩册太师。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42032,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"太师还政异寻常，前殿铺张册礼忙。\n入对谁知年八十，身轻拜舞谢吾皇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42033,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其三","author":"范纯仁","text":"吾皇重喜见仪形，对御排场结綵棚。\n才见罢时先赐宴，御前亲劝一金觥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42034,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其四","author":"范纯仁","text":"上前一饮釂金觥，侍宴群公喜且惊。\n吕尚鬻熊今复见，神仙不必在蓬瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42035,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其五","author":"范纯仁","text":"蓬瀛闻说有仙居，甲第园林想亦如。\n绕圃琅玕抽翠竹，平流瑟瑟走清渠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42036,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其六","author":"范纯仁","text":"清渠泻水灌东田，十顷方塘不种莲。\n白鸟往来明镜里，画船安稳坐青天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42037,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其七","author":"范纯仁","text":"天上虽传周伯星，应期为瑞有常经。\n未如全享康宁福，访水寻山到处行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42038,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其八","author":"范纯仁","text":"行乐心清日日添，诗豪酒健独能兼。\n从容对客忘威重，自是天真不是谦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42039,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其九","author":"范纯仁","text":"谦虚久已得民心，三尹西都惠爱深。\n一自安车朝阙去，万人侧耳听归音。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42040,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"效宫词体上文太师十绝 其十","author":"范纯仁","text":"归日天恩赐画船，倾城士女尽迎观。\n园家连夜惊筠笼，为趁明朝献牡丹。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42041,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子华游韩王园怀故园池莲红薇二首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"丞相园池冠壁田，娉婷次第坼红莲。\n主人居守麟符重，谁见新妆照水妍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42042,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和子华游韩王园怀故园池莲红薇二首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"鲜葩嫩蕊吐香浓，千朵妖饶颤晚风。\n却想许园仙品盛，姝衣轻透玉肌红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42043,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"再赴蒲津陪解梁张守安邑王宰游静林","author":"范纯仁","text":"千骑翩翩逐郡侯，条山重继昔年游。\n翠深叠嶂烟岚晚，绿满长郊稼穑秋。\n胜概不知行客老，征骖聊为主人留。\n预思别后登临处，应见黄河入海流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42044,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠张大夫","author":"范纯仁","text":"白首衰颜愧复来，当时怀抱向谁开。\n登临彷佛惊前梦，游赏从容忆旧台。\n旨酒欲斟怀老伴，高吟难敌想天才。\n会须早逐君归去，茅屋荒田半草莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42045,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄上文潞公","author":"范纯仁","text":"孙阁重登愧玳簪，情同倦翼托高林。\n嵩邙未敌仁基厚，河洛宁如福海深。\n善教每闻当镂骨，重知难报欲沾襟。\n至诚怀德逾饥渴，不比寻常势利心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42046,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄上西京留守子华相公","author":"范纯仁","text":"疏顽曾是费炉锤，从昔叨蒙国士知。\n一阻门墙惊岁月，几回魂梦到嵩伊。\n神仙客佩黄金印，燕赵人斟白玉卮。\n薄宦浪抛东阁去，君恩未报叹衰迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42047,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄鲜于子骏西台","author":"范纯仁","text":"僚友难逢不世贤，洛台经岁共清閒。\n蒹葭岂合依良玉，培塿何能望泰山。\n直道难堪从俗尚，清新原足重人间。\n期君致主登廊庙，茅屋荒田我自还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42048,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和薛中散踏青词","author":"范纯仁","text":"绕郭依依柳渐青，绮罗深处画船横。\n坐中唯欠贤乡老，把酒向风无限情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42049,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄和子华相公王园赏梅","author":"范纯仁","text":"玉艳霜葩万朵攒，曾陪宴席醉中看。\n西州纵有寻花处，亦待顽童格舞干。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42050,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题河中府名阃堂","author":"范纯仁","text":"谁擘中条太华开，万家填郭耸楼台。\n岳呈仙掌日边见，河泻龙门天上来。\n烟霭远分秦甸阔，山川都抱舜城回。\n坚碑应是当年石，重见吾皇咏起哉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42051,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题张运使先垄永慕亭","author":"范纯仁","text":"武夷山色倚天青，中有贤儒谢世荣。\n自以高名传积庆，不教黄壤掩清名。\n构亭傍垄同虚寝，陟岵无时见孝诚。\n宁独显亲由富贵，还能厚德庇群生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42052,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入河中府","author":"范纯仁","text":"道傍禾忝穗交垂，旌旆纷纷曳綵霓。\n山夹两河嗟地险，云埋万堞觉城低。\n十年不到身如梦，五马重来路欲迷。\n却据归鞍下长坂，辕门迎谒引行齐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42053,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢张解州作名阃堂记","author":"范纯仁","text":"气如巨浪泻长江，清似寒冰满玉缸。\n几与贾生摩壁垒，未令张子见麾幢。\n色丝幼妇宜传久，肉袒牵羊合亟降。\n欲近云章刊翠石，却忧染翰孰能双。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42054,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日席上","author":"范纯仁","text":"边霜肃肃满川梁，无限秋怀付一觞。\n白酒聊同佳客醉，黄花不减故园香。\n民兵已许归南亩，圣泽行闻赦叛羌。\n得脱征衣归里社，大能酩酊乐时康。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42055,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游寡阜庙二首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"古祠东北据孤峰，台殿岧峣出半空。\n廛市纵横棋局布，云烟重叠画图中。\n登高览胜惭吾祖，放意寻山忆谢公。\n却爱夕阳照归骑，翩翩旗旆满川红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42056,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游寡阜庙二首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"逾旬积雨喜新晴，民物熙然百谷成。\n风叶萧骚林野薄，霜天寥廓日华清。\n千山甫隔乌延塞，两水傍临不窟城。\n但得年丰人足食，犬羊馀种岂须平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42057,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和韩持国见赠兼简王微之","author":"范纯仁","text":"身由疲病难从政，性本颛愚不学禅。\n到老岂能成一事，饥餐渴饮谩随缘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42058,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和持国","author":"范纯仁","text":"时奉清欢消鄙吝，真同寒水涤尘沙。\n尊倾玉粒醅浮蚁，丛合金英菊有花。\n湖面烟霞如泽国，波心亭馆似仙家。\n四时风月皆堪赏，不独霜前爱物华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42059,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"范纯仁","text":"横笛佳人用意深，数声高起潩湖阴。\n梅花落尽还堪惜，留取残英伴醉吟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42060,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖四时四首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"白鹭文鸳鉴里飞，红桥朱阁影参差。\n疏林密雪皆堪赏，不特寻芳避暑时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42061,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖四时四首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"万顷琉璃蹙翠鳞，日迟风暖物华新。\n千花百草游人路，应谓壶中别有春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42062,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖四时四首 其三","author":"范纯仁","text":"深堂高阁启清风，舟泛荷香柳影中。\n日月待公逃暑饮，官无拘检是琳宫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42063,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖四时四首 其四","author":"范纯仁","text":"夕阳照水晚登楼，皎月涵波夜泛舟。\n珍重前贤开展意，中年长愿守閒州。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42064,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和微之以足疾不赴西湖赏雪","author":"范纯仁","text":"年来遇景彊追攀，长恐身衰兴易阑。\n八十康宁天下少，四并聚会古为难。\n客尘随念须频拂，世网萦人且自宽。\n布政未能跻乐俗，爱贤犹喜共清欢。\n湖光映雪凝深碧，野色当轩展素纨。\n心似白公何虑脚，燕堂深暖小安禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42065,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和持国赠微之","author":"范纯仁","text":"元老邀宾乐事并，每居右席愧群英。\n里中耆旧唯公长，醉里篇章映古清。\n柔袂缓舒鸾鹤舞，短箫轻引凤凰鸣。\n莫嫌尊酒过从数，向老交游更有情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42066,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠持国持国以瑞鹧鸪歌之","author":"范纯仁","text":"三十年来解榻宾，今朝重喜奉陈蕃。\n松筠雅操寒逾劲，胶漆深情老益敦。\n槐位已惭同致主，棠阴还许继为藩。\n古今此会应难得，醉饮休辞罄绿尊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42067,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢微之见赠","author":"范纯仁","text":"属邑逢公喜望尘，便陪将漕向江滨。\n当时早重朋僚契，晚岁重敦道义亲。\n华衮已惭无德称，琳宫弥羡最閒身。\n相过无惜频欢醉，八十康宁有几人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42068,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和持国光禄堂赏梅兼寄彝叟德孺","author":"范纯仁","text":"叨荣报国老无成，辞疾还乡负物情。\n身近良朋如倚玉，心怀诸弟若摇旌。\n成行每羡随阳雁，得友何惭出谷莺。\n光禄官閒容谒告，扫除门巷待同行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42069,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉寄西京玉汝相公","author":"范纯仁","text":"三纪荣途愧汇征，数逢忧患见交情。\n江吴切喜陪经席，关陕还容并使旌。\n大尹綵旟方画隼，上阳乔木欲迁莺。\n铜驼金谷春游盛，谁伴朱轮五马行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42070,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和持国听琵琶二首 其一","author":"范纯仁","text":"美人成列抹朱弦，劝得嘉宾醉满筵。\n却笑西湖游赏处，村歌社舞谩盈船。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42071,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和持国听琵琶二首 其二","author":"范纯仁","text":"须知绝艺好娱宾，能使知音作伯伦。\n累月应将笞乐籍，恐公重作独醒人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":42072,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]